{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The neodymium disc magnets connect directly to my two recent magnetic hook purchases and could support similar mounting projects.",
    "The magnets fit my recent interest in attaching and securing things, although bare discs are less immediately useful to me than ready-to-use hooks."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The bearings, grinder discs and bench brush require specific dimensions, equipment or projects that my recent purchases do not establish.",
    "The masks, replacement plug, epoxy, ball chains and wire mesh do not address a current need for me; possible usefulness alone would not make me choose them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Buying fasteners and magnetic hooks seems to have been taken as interest in almost any workshop supply.",
    "Items that could be used around hardware projects were treated as relevant without a clear connection to what I am trying to attach or secure."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated magnetic hook purchases are a stronger clue to my current interests than my older hand-truck purchase.",
    "Function and fit matter: hooks provide an immediate mounting use, while bare magnets need an additional plan and specialized parts need a specific application."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my interest in magnetic mounting but stretched it into a broad interest in workshop supplies that I have no reason to buy now."
}"}
